          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\cap\\overline{B})&=P(A)-P(A\\cap B)\\\\P(A\\cap\\overline{B})&=P(A)-P(A)P(B)\\\\P(A\\cap\\overline{B})&=P(A)(1-P(B))\\\\P(A\\cap\\overline{B})&=P(A)P(\\overline{B}).\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore, $A$ and $\\overline{B}$ are independent.",
